---
source: src/completion/engine.rs
expression: "screen(&[\"nut\", \"status\", \"-\"], 100)"
---
Options
      --watch                   Continuously refresh the status view
      --all                     Include raw NUT variables
      --ups <UPS>               UPS name (defaults to the selected host configuration, or primary)
      --upsd-address <ADDRESS>  Loopback upsd address (defaults to host configuration, or…
      --upsd-port <PORT>        Loopback upsd port (defaults to host configuration, or 3493)
  -h, --help                    Print help
Global options
      --color <WHEN>            Color output policy
      --ascii                   Use ASCII symbols and bars
  -j, --json                    Emit machine-readable JSON where supported
  -v, --verbose                 Include additional diagnostic detail
  -c, --config <PATH>           Read host settings from this file
